BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:CPKC Women's Open Golf Days in the ICE District
DTSTART;TZID=America/Edmonton:20130729T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Edmonton:20130729T180000
DTSTAMP:20260815T130234Z
UID:ff2d41bcc37dae537c94425b47d86ca1@explore-edmonton-calendar
ATTACH:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/gallery/Edmonton_Downtown
 _ICE-District-1_2026-06-09-171011_powb.jpg
DESCRIPTION:For avid golfers\, beginners\, and fun-seekers alike!\n\nHead 
 to the ICE District Plaza every Wednesday from 11:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m. for
  a series of free\, family-friendly golf events leading up to the CPKC Wom
 en’s Open\, returning to Edmonton this August for the first time since 2
 013.\n\nTest your skills on the PGX Mini Golf Course\, take on the long pu
 tt challenge\, learn more about She Plays Golf and First Tee – Alberta\,
  and discover the impact these programs are making with youth across the p
 rovince. Guests can also explore everything the CPKC Women’s Open has to
  offer.\n\nEnjoy food trucks\, prizes\, and giveaways throughout the day\,
  including chances to win tickets to the CPKC Women’s Open!\n\nEVENT INF
 ORMATION\nSchedule: Monday\, July 29\, 2013 at 11:00 AM–6:00 PM\nLocatio
 n: ICE District - 10360 102 St\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nTickets / Visit 
 site: https://www.cpkcwomensopen.com/\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreed
 monton.com/event-calendar/cpkc-womens-open-golf-days-in-the-ice-district
LAST-MODIFIED:20260815T125922Z
LOCATION:ICE District - 10360 102 St\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/cpkc-womens-open-golf-days-
 in-the-ice-district
