 kers alike!</p><p>Head to the ICE District Plaza every Wednesday from 11:0
 0 a.m. to 6:00 p.m. for a series of free\, family-friendly golf events lea
 ding up to the CPKC Women’s Open\, returning to Edmonton this August for
  the first time since 2013.</p><p>Test your skills on the PGX Mini Golf Co
 urse\, take on the long putt challenge\, learn more about She Plays Golf a
 nd First Tee – Alberta\, and discover the impact these programs are maki
