BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Lunar Eclipse Viewing at the RASC Observatory
DTSTART;TZID=America/Edmonton:20260827T203000
DTSTAMP:20260815T130234Z
UID:83d08c621b912356eb7afabde6ad89f5@explore-edmonton-calendar
ATTACH:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/Event-2-Lunar-Eclipse-2.j
 peg
DESCRIPTION:The night sky is putting on a show!\n\nCalling all space enthu
 siasts! Join TELUS World of Science – Edmonton and the Royal Astronomica
 l Society of Edmonton to experience the lunar eclipse\, beginning at 8:30 
 p.m.\n\nDiscover the science behind the Moon as you observe the eclipse th
 rough one of their observatory telescopes and enjoy a closer look at our n
 earest celestial neighbor!\n\nEVENT INFORMATION\nSchedule: Thursday\, Augu
 st 27\, 2026 at 8:30 PM\nLocation: TELUS World of Science - Edmonton\, 112
 11 142 St\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA\nExplore Edmonton: https://exploreedmo
 nton.com/event-calendar/lunar-eclipse-viewing-at-the-rasc-observatory
LAST-MODIFIED:20260815T130053Z
LOCATION:TELUS World of Science - Edmonton\, 11211 142 St\, Edmonton\, Alb
 erta\, CA
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/lunar-eclipse-viewing-at-th
 e-rasc-observatory
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>The night sky is putting on a show!</p><p>
 Calling all space enthusiasts! Join TELUS World of Science – Edmonton an
 d the Royal Astronomical Society of Edmonton to experience the lunar eclip
 se\, beginning at 8:30 p.m.</p><p>Discover the science behind the Moon as 
 you observe the eclipse through one of their observatory telescopes and en
 joy a closer look at our nearest celestial neighbor!</p><h3>Event Informat
 ion</h3><ul><li><strong>Schedule:</strong> Thursday\, August 27\, 2026 at 
 8:30 PM</li><li><strong>Location:</strong> TELUS World of Science - Edmont
 on\, 11211 142 St\, Edmonton\, Alberta\, CA</li><li><strong>Explore Edmont
 on:</strong> https://exploreedmonton.com/event-calendar/lunar-eclipse-view
 ing-at-the-rasc-observatory</li></ul>
X-IMAGE:https://assets.exploreedmonton.com/images/Event-2-Lunar-Eclipse-2.
 jpeg
